---
---
<section aria-label="Impact" style="box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; background: #F7F7F4; color: #251F19; font-family: var(--font-text); -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;">
  <div style="box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; max-width: calc(1280px + 2 * var(--gutter)); margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(56px, 8vw, 104px) var(--gutter); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: clamp(32px, 4vw, 48px);">

    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px;">
      <span style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--brand);">Impact</span>
      <h2 style="margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 500; font-size: clamp(32px, 3.4vw, 48px); line-height: 1.12; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: #251F19;">Outcomes that matter</h2>
      <p style="margin: 0; align-self: flex-start; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 8px 16px 8px 8px; border-radius: 999px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E4E0DD; font-size: 15px; color: #251F19;"><span style="padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 999px; background: #D3F0E4; color: #0B5B3D; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600;">Live</span>Phase 1 is live with the client for testing.</p>
    </div>

    <div style="box-sizing: border-box; padding: clamp(8px, 2.4vw, 32px) clamp(20px, 3.4vw, 44px); border-radius: 24px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #EBE8E4;">
      <ol aria-label="Before and after" style="list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0;">
        <li class="irow" style="padding: clamp(20px, 2.6vw, 28px) 0;">
          <h3 style="margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(18px, 1.6vw, 21px); font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.3; color: #251F19;">Improved hiring visibility</h3>
          <div class="ibox" style="box-sizing: border-box; padding: 16px 18px; border-radius: 12px; background: #F1F0EB; border: 1px solid #EBE8E4;"><span class="ilab" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 6px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; color: #68615A;">Before</span><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: #68615A;">Status lived in inboxes and spreadsheet rows.</p></div>
          <span class="iarr" aria-hidden="true" style="width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 999px; background: #E3EEFA; color: var(--accent); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; justify-self: center;"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></span>
          <div class="ibox" style="box-sizing: border-box; padding: 16px 18px; border-radius: 12px; background: var(--accent);"><span class="ilab" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 6px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; color: #A9C4E4;">After</span><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: #FFFFFF;">One pipeline view across every candidate and stage, no spreadsheets.</p></div>
        </li>
        <li class="irow" style="padding: clamp(20px, 2.6vw, 28px) 0; border-top: 1px solid #EBE8E4;">
          <h3 style="margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(18px, 1.6vw, 21px); font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.3; color: #251F19;">Reduced duplication errors</h3>
          <div class="ibox" style="box-sizing: border-box; padding: 16px 18px; border-radius: 12px; background: #F1F0EB; border: 1px solid #EBE8E4;"><span class="ilab" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 6px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; color: #68615A;">Before</span><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: #68615A;">The same candidate was submitted by more than one recruiter or vendor.</p></div>
          <span class="iarr" aria-hidden="true" style="width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 999px; background: #E3EEFA; color: var(--accent); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; justify-self: center;"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></span>
          <div class="ibox" style="box-sizing: border-box; padding: 16px 18px; border-radius: 12px; background: var(--accent);"><span class="ilab" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 6px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; color: #A9C4E4;">After</span><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: #FFFFFF;">Ownership is checked before submission, so conflicts never reach the team.</p></div>
        </li>
        <li class="irow" style="padding: clamp(20px, 2.6vw, 28px) 0; border-top: 1px solid #EBE8E4;">
          <h3 style="margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(18px, 1.6vw, 21px); font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.3; color: #251F19;">Scalable operations</h3>
          <div class="ibox" style="box-sizing: border-box; padding: 16px 18px; border-radius: 12px; background: #F1F0EB; border: 1px solid #EBE8E4;"><span class="ilab" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 6px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; color: #68615A;">Before</span><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: #68615A;">Workflows couldn&#8217;t scale across teams, vendors or hiring stages.</p></div>
          <span class="iarr" aria-hidden="true" style="width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 999px; background: #E3EEFA; color: var(--accent); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; justify-self: center;"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></span>
          <div class="ibox" style="box-sizing: border-box; padding: 16px 18px; border-radius: 12px; background: var(--accent);"><span class="ilab" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 6px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; color: #A9C4E4;">After</span><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: #FFFFFF;">A multi-tenant setup serves N organizations from one platform.</p></div>
        </li>
        <li class="irow" style="padding: clamp(20px, 2.6vw, 28px) 0; border-top: 1px solid #EBE8E4;">
          <h3 style="margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(18px, 1.6vw, 21px); font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.3; color: #251F19;">Trust through guided flows</h3>
          <div class="ibox" style="box-sizing: border-box; padding: 16px 18px; border-radius: 12px; background: #F1F0EB; border: 1px solid #EBE8E4;"><span class="ilab" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 6px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; color: #68615A;">Before</span><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: #68615A;">Complex setup was spread across email threads and scattered sheets.</p></div>
          <span class="iarr" aria-hidden="true" style="width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 999px; background: #E3EEFA; color: var(--accent); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; justify-self: center;"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></span>
          <div class="ibox" style="box-sizing: border-box; padding: 16px 18px; border-radius: 12px; background: var(--accent);"><span class="ilab" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 6px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; color: #A9C4E4;">After</span><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: #FFFFFF;">Step-by-step flows build confidence in high-stakes, error-prone tasks.</p></div>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
.irow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,3fr) minmax(0,4fr) 44px minmax(0,4fr);gap:16px;align-items:stretch}
.irow>h3,.irow>.iarr{align-self:center}
.ibox{min-height:104px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}
@media (max-width: 900px){.irow{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:10px}.ibox{min-height:0}.iarr{transform:rotate(90deg)}}
</style>
